WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.980
A-tan! A-tan!

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.770
What on earth is it? 
You're making too much noise.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.190
You have to introduce yourself, A-tan.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.610
Remember, it's your turn this week.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:17.620
You mean, I should explain my 
relationship with you to everyone?

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.410
Uh... yeah, sure.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.660
I can't do that.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.210
Because... I no longer have my 
memories as Athena Tennousu.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.590
Now I'm just a child named Alice.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.130
Yeah, you're right.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.590
Sorry, I asked you to 
do something you can't.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.730
I'm Alice.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:51.150
<b>Athena Tennousu (Alice Version)</b>

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:48.650
Due to certain reasons, I'm living in the 
closet in Hinagiku-san's room.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.150
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.280
Thanks, A-tan!

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.660
It's not like I did it for you.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:58.910
Yeah.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.800
<b>Lost Dog </b>
Looking for this dog. 
If you find him, please call this number.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:43.260
I slept right through the alarm again.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.640
I need to get my daily 
routine in better order—

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.980
<i>Taking in some sunlight will 
reset my internal clock,</i>

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.030
<i>so I'll feel refreshed when I wake up...</i>

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.040
<i>Wake...</i>

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.820
Morning, A-tan. Did you sleep well?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.950
I-I wasn't falling asleep again!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.660
More importantly, don't you 
have my breakfast ready yet?!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.620
I want to eat sweet 
bread in the mornings!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:16.000
Oh, then, I have a chocolate coronet 
that's perfect for you. Do you want it?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.050
Perfect for me? How so?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.510
Well, of course, because...

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.510
See? It's ringlet-shaped!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.140
Just make some pancakes.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.930
Yes, sir...

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.480
Honestly, that Hayate... 
How does this look like my ringlets?

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.770
Who needs that kind of joke 
first thing in the morning?

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:49.450
A-tan?!

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.660
What is it, A-tan?! Are you oka—

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.420
Hayate... Hayate!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.920
A-tan is in trouble!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.760
Where did this dog come from, anyway?!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:08.580
What was that?! 
Where did that dog suddenly come from?!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.980
Ow... Maybe it's a stray.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.480
It's really big for a stray, though.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.270
Maybe it's someone's pet.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.230
Hayate...

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.150
Could you hurry up and 
find its owner, then?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.530
Yeah, you're right. I'll check around.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.240
How could a huge dog like you get lost?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.040
You must really be dumb.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:34.540
You're gonna crush me! 
Do you never learn?!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.800
See? You can do it.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.970
Is this what you want?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.840
Okay, just a little...

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.140
Stupid dog!

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.350
I've got it, A-tan! 
I found this lost dog flyer...

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.440
What are you doing?

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.980
Why don't you ask him?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.940
You really are stupid.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.940
You have to stop at traffic lights.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.940
And then look right and left.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.280
Okay, come on.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.450
You stop on red, and proceed on green.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.370
Don't just take off running!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:14.540
Walk at the same speed as 
everyone else! Got that?

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.500
Honestly, the only thing you're 
good at is responding.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.590
Looks like you two are 
getting along well.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.010
Wh-Why would you think that?!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.470
It's not like I care about this dog...

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:28.010
Armageddon!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.140
Armageddon, it's you!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.350
That's my family's dog, Armageddon!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.140
He was gone for three hours! 
We were so worried!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.560
Armage—

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.940
As always, you've got a great tackle!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.530
M-My arm! You're gonna tear 
my arm off, Armageddon!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.700
Looks like we found the owner
 without even trying.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.200
A-tan?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:56.000
Y-Yes, I'm glad we 
found her so quickly.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.170
Don't get lost again, okay?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.130
Hey, that tickles!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:07.670
Looks like Armageddon loves you.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.260
That's not true...

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.260
No, I'm sure he loves you.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.140
Because...

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:20.730
Your hair looks just like his 
favorite treat, chocolate coronets!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.730
<b>Do not give dogs chocolate.</b>

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.860
We're going home, Hayate.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.570
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.570
Doujinshi & Games        Come on in!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.570
<b>Comic             Tachibana</b>

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.570
What is she thinking?!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.570
There's 100 million yen here!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.450
Wouldn't one normally transfer amounts 
this large into your bank account?

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:37.960
Hey, Sakuya!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:41.040
Is this Wataru? Did the operating 
funds for your store arrive?

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.790
Why did you send all this in cash?!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.760
It's as my favorite book says,

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.640
"If you want to grow, sleep with 
your money clutched in your arms."

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.300
<b>Murmurs...</b>

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.890
Take a good look at the 
actual amount you borrowed,

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.690
not just the numbers in your bank book.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.810
Yeah, but still...

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:05.480
You want to be more 
of a man, don't you?

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.110
Wh-What did she say?

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.450
This is all the money I've 
invested in this store.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:16.450
It's the very thing that 
will determine my future.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.950
I have to be careful not to lose it.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.960
Excuse me!

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.250
It's the one person most 
likely to lose it!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.050
What did you come here for?!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.180
What for...? To return the 
DVD that Miss Nagi rented...

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.680
Doujinshi & Games        Come on in!

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.680
<b>Comic</b>

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.680
<b>Tachibana</b>

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.680
Wow! Isn't that 100 million yen?!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:38.140
Sakuya-san sure is amazing.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.640
She went too far.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:43.350
Young Master, don't you think it's a 
bad idea to just leave it sitting here?

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.900
Yeah. I guess I'll go deposit it.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.110
Then, I'll go with you.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.360
I vehemently decline!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.110
Why?

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:53.280
It's not that I don't trust you,

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.870
but there's no one more likely 
to lose money than you.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:01.710
Oh, come on. It won't disappear 
just because I touched it.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:06.500
It's true that I have a 
150 million yen debt, but...

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.710
In that case, you and I shall go!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.630
Then let's just put it in this pouch...

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.720
Oh, it doesn't fit.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.470
We'll put the rest in these 
convenience store bags.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.300
Okay...

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.050
We're off.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.970
I'm going with you!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:20.970
<b>Temporarily Closed</b>

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:20.970
<b>Sorry</b>

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.940
It's pretty heavy.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.020
100 million yen weighs ten kilograms.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.230
I just hope nothing happens.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.900
Nothing's going to happen.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:33.950
Armageddon!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.490
Young Master! Are you okay?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.200
Forget about me! 
Get the 100 million yen!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.330
100 million yen?

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:43.410
There's 100 million yen in here?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.630
Wh-What are you talking about, Sensei?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.630
There's no way 
100 million yen is in there.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.130
Uh, but he just said "100 million yen."

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.170
I'm not going to steal it

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.340
when the one who dropped 
it is right in front of me.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.640
Besides, I am a teacher, you know.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.890
Have a little faith in me.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.270
I'm sorry...

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.190
Saki!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.230
Oh, no!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.990
Another great day to 
have fun skipping!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.370
Well, well! I was wondering who 
it was, and it's Armageddon,

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.620
the dog with the big body and tiny brain,
 who does nothing but eat for free!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.510
Bad dog! You're enough of a glutton 
already, but scavenging is—

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:37.510
Th-This is money! 
Way to go! No, I mean...

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.970
Where did you find this?!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.770
We have to get this to the police.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.060
So you've finally gone 
and done it, Fumi-chan.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.350
Y-You've got it all wrong, Sharna-chan!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.770
Armageddon brought this here...

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:55.780
Yes, it may be true that 
Armageddon brought it here, but...

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.280
Armageddon is your dog!

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:02.740
That means, if he stole something, 
it's just the same as if you had stolen it!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.910
How could this happen?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:09.120
At some point, I became a thief...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.500
As long as you understand, Fumi-chan.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.050
How serious is my crime?

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.260
How many thousands of yen will 
my crime cost, Sharna-chan?!

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:21.510
For starters, if the police 
find you, you'll be executed.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.140
My life was too short...

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.020
Armageddon! Where are
 you going, Armageddon?!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.700
Our precious operating funds 
are gone because of me...

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.780
It's not your fault.

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:47.200
If I had been holding 
the briefcase more tightly...

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.580
H-Hey, don't cry.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:55.170
Um, I think I recognized 
that dog, so I'll go look for him.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.300
You two, file a robbery report.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.920
Okay. We'll count on you.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.630
Sure. Leave it to me.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.470
Um...

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.560
If the 100 million isn't found, I'll...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.520
I'll quit the store 
and find another job,

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.560
and I'll work hard to make 
the 100 million back...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.820
If I can't find the dog, 
the owner should be...

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.240
There she is!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.070
Quick! We've got to get 
that briefcase back!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:25.490
Why? If you tell the police that the dog
 did it, they might believe you now.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:29.450
No! My fingerprints are 
on that briefcase!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:32.370
If I confess before I wipe them 
all off, I'll still be a suspect!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.710
You've actually thought 
this out, Fumi-chan.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:38.840
Anyway! If we don't do 
something, I'll be arrested!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:39.420
Excuse me...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.220
I'm sorry! I'm sorry I was born!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:45.010
I didn't take the money! 
Please don't execute me!

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.140
U-Uh...

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:49.470
If you're looking for the dog that took 
the briefcase, he's not here anymore.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.480
He went running off somewhere.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.560
Somewhere?

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.650
Did you run away again?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.040
What's that? Did you bring it for me?

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.000
I'm so happy! Good boy, Armageddon!

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:15.040
I thought I'd find you here.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.670
Hayate?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.130
I found him. The money is safe.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.920
Really?! I'll be right there!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.050
What do you mean, "money"?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.640
Wataru-kun's 100 million yen is in there.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.600
Yes, at the apartment. Yes.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:32.810
So you got wrapped up 
in money related trouble again.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.480
Yeah. But it's a good thing 
I found it so quickly.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.230
It doesn't look like there's 
any money in there.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.990
What are you going to do, Hayate?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.160
What should I do?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.740
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.200
Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.450
You seem to be good 
friends with a lot of girls.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.750
Do you have any actual guy friends?

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.880
What are you talking about, A-tan?

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.000
Of course I have a guy friend.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.510
And does he consider you a friend?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.550
How about it, Hayate?

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.890
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.260
Commercial Connecting Theater.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.430
I need you.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.390
I don't need a god of poverty!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.940
He's not going to go after her?

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.980
What a pathetic guy.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.360
Did you find my 100 million yen?

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.620
Okay, let's blow this 
scene, Armageddon.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.660
You mustn't destroy the 
evidence, Fumi-chan.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.870
S-Sorry, Sharna-chan.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.410
We need to think about where 
it may have been lost.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.880
Armageddon! Where did you 
lose it?! Tell the truth!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.460
"Woof" doesn't tell me anything!
 Speak in Japanese!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:47.130
Say something besides "woof" now and then!
 You have to, Armageddon!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.010
Looks like Armageddon won't 
talk no matter what we do!

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:57.640
If only we understood animal language, 
we could hear your story.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.940
Someone who understands animal language 
and can speak human language...

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.110
Wait, there is someone!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.200
Tama! Come with me!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.950
Meow, meow meow?!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.320
Oh, it's just the butler with the debt.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.040
Who's that?

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.210
Someone who says, "I understand
 animal language. I do.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:23.300
They always pretend to be 
animals, and badmouth me."

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.670
It doesn't look like 
this will work at all.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.720
Hurry up!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.220
Fine, fine.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.050
Well? What happened to the 100 
million that was in here?

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.270
Vile scum, kept as a pet by humans!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.060
I have nothing to say to you!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.730
You live in shame, trash.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:45.440
We are free! Freedom
 allows our souls to soar!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.110
Quit grumbling and spit 
it out, you stupid mutt!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.910
Quit fighting, you two!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.910
A couple of guys stole 
the money out of it?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:58.620
Yes.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.080
I'll do my best to look for them, too.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:01.750
Yes.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.880
That's it. Learn the 
smell of the contents.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.880
What are you doing, A-tan?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.760
This is no time to be disheartened.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:10.800
Young Master...

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.930
You go back to the store! Got it?

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.680
<i>It hasn't been long since the 
100 million yen was stolen.</i>

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.940
<i>It shouldn't be difficult 
to pick up the trail.</i>

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.360
I'm depending on you, Armageddon!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.490
<b>Takoyaki</b>

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.400
Guess I have no choice...

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.490
Come on, hurry up!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:34.620
<b>Soft Serve - 300 yen</b>

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.820
What? Again?

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.620
Are you taking this seriously?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.500
I'm about to get angry.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:42.710
<b>Yakitori</b>

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.040
This isn't the smell you're 
supposed to be following!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.300
Ow...

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.640
<b>Kebab</b>

00:15:58.850 --> 00:15:59.980
It's here?

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.520
Seems so.

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.230
Sure looks like the place.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.480
Wataru-kun!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.730
Wait here, A-tan.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:08.570
But...

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:11.190
Don't worry. I'll be right back.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.990
Hayate...

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:20.910
Give me back my 100 million yen!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.080
I swear...

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.750
Can't let my guard down for a second.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.380
Now then...

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:39.510
O-Of course, I was going to 
bring it back to you guys!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.730
O-Of course you were.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.230
<b>Thank you for your deposit.</b>

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.230
<b>Complete deposit 

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.310
That'll do it.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.060
<b>Welcome 
Please select your desired transaction.</b>

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.060
<b>Deposit 

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:50.030
Sorry about all this. 
You really saved me.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.940
You should thank him.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.900
Thank you.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.780
Though it was his fault 
in the first place...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.080
If we hadn't found the money,

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.580
Saki would've felt responsible, 
and kept on crying forever.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.630
Sounds like there's someone 
who's important to you.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.210
Y-Yeah...

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.170
Then you should protect her,

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:15.260
so she doesn't slip 
through your fingers.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.550
Yeah. I know.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.850
<b>Tachibana</b>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.850
<b>Comic</b>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.850
Doujinshi & Games         Come on in!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:25.190
What are you so depressed for?

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:26.770
Young Master...

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.190
Did you find the money?!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.190
Yeah. I just put it in the bank.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:36.320
Thank goodness... I'm so glad...

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:37.780
So...

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.780
Don't ever say that 
you're going to quit again.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:45.660
But if I stay, I'll cause 
more trouble for you...

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.540
Saki.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.460
I don't care, as long as 
you're beside me, so...

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.090
Stay with me forever.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.090
Y-Young Master...

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.930
Let's get fired up, Saki!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.010
<b>Tachibana</b>

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.010
<b>Comic</b>

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.010
Doujinshi & Games   Come on in!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:01.640
Right!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.270
You did a good job, Armageddon.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:10.980
That's odd. It looks like Armageddon 
likes you more than me.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.480
It must be because of 
the chocolate coronet!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.740
Y-You stupid dog!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.080
Nagi, I'm going out.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.870
Microwave and eat. -Maria

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.370
Meat buns?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.630
Not that I mind, but just 
one of these fills me up.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.710
Oh, those look tasty.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.930
You want one, too? 
You can have a whole one.

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:43.140
A whole one?

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.020
If we can't finish them, 
we can give the rest to Tama.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.360
That's true.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.990
Okay, let's get right to it...

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:57.820
There.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.280
<b>Automatic</b>

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.280
<b>Heat       Healthy</b>

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.280
<b>

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.280
<b>

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.830
<b>Start</b>

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:02.990
Wh-What is all this?

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:03.830
I don't know...

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:07.750
Shouldn't we just push the 
one that says "start"?

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.830
Really? It won't blow up 
or anything, will it?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.670
Oh well. These things are made to 
get it right one way or another.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.710
<b>Steam/Boil                            Bake/Fry</b>

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.800
They melted.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.220
Indeed.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.640
We can't eat this.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:26.720
<b>Goopy</b>

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.220
Indeed.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.430
But I'm hungry...

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:30.980
Indeed...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:34.360
I'm sure Maria will be 
back by this evening,

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.400
but I don't think I can 
hold out that long.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.940
Indeed...

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.030
What should we do?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.990
The butler's working at the 
café right now, isn't he?

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.530
Why don't you just go there to eat?

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:50.160
Not that you can hear me, 
since I'm a ghost and all.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.500
That's it!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:55.040
Going to Hayate's café is a good idea!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.170
Oh, yeah!

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:59.760
If we go to Café Donguri, we can 
have Hayate make us dinner!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.090
Okay, let's go there now!

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:02.800
Yeah!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.560
Thanks for the good idea.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.190
Do you know the way?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:17.020
Not to worry! I always 
see it from Hayate's bike.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.020
So...

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.490
I-I think it's this way!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:25.450
You think?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.950
Not to worry! Just trust my intuition!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.290
Weird...

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.880
It takes no time to get 
there on Hayate's bike...

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.550
That powerhouse is not 
to be underestimated.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:46.640
You said it. Neither downhill 
nor uphill slopes bother him.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.010
Oh!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.720
Let's buy some drinks!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.020
Good idea.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.850
There's no slot for a card.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:55.770
Yeah...

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.230
However, I have this!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:20:59.690
Ooh, I see!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.190
<b>Vending</b>

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:06.700
<b>Taguchi Clinic</b>

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.610
Sure is far away...

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.700
Indeed.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.990
I'm hungry and thirsty.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:12.910
I want some of Hayate's 
cooking right now.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:13.960
Indeed.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.130
So, which dish of Hayate's 
do you like best?

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.630
His beef stew.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.460
Yeah, his stew and potstickers 
are great too, huh?

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:25.430
And the egg and tomato stir-fry 
he made for me the other day.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.470
His fried eggs are good, too.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:30.310
This is...

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:31.760
What is it?

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.430
I recognize this street!

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.270
We go up that hill and go 
straight, and we're there!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.310
But...

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:40.110
That's quite an uphill slope...

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:41.270
Yeah...

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.400
There's a convenience store!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:46.950
You're right!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.070
We can use our cards here!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.200
Tasty Bento Festival

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.200
We can buy all the meat 
buns and drinks we want!

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:55.120
Yay! Now we can just buy 
meat buns to take home!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.960
But if we go up this hill...

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.000
Hayate is...

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:10.010
<b>Café Donguri</b>

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.010
Hayate-kun, I'm done 
cleaning over here.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:10.010
Thank you, Nishizawa-san.

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:13.260
Welco— Huh?

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:17.100
What are you two doing here?

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.560
We came all the way here to eat!

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:21.860
That's right! Aren't we amazing?!

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.110
W-Well, I guess so...

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:27.650
Okay, I'll make you something.

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.110
What would you like?

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:30.280
Meat buns!

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:31.370
What?!

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:06.750
Looks like it's our turn next!

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:07.210
Is it?

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:08.840
We're gonna do that thing, right?

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:09.920
Of course!

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:11.090
Nice Cutie!

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:12.300
Cutie Mate!

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:12.880
Hey!

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.720
Come on, you too, Isumi-san...

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:17.010
You're lost already?!

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:20.520
The Cutie Touch is surprisingly fun!
